    cautions: "Retains marine biotoxins for an unusually long time — it depurates slowly, so it can remain unsafe for weeks to months after a bloom has cleared and after other clams test clean, comparable to the toxin-retentive butter clam. Never rely on the water 'looking fine.' As an estuarine filter/deposit feeder it can also pick up local pollutants.",
