    regulations: "California only. Sport fishing license required (age 16+) and a rigid, accurate measuring gauge must be in your possession. Minimum legal size 4.5 in (greatest shell diameter) south of, and 5 in north of, the San Luis Obispo/Monterey County line. Daily bag AND possession limit: 10 clams. Undersized clams must be reburied immediately. No hydraulic pumps, spears, or gaff hooks (CCR Title 14, Sec. 29.20/29.40, CDFW).",
